WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.002
Video four. The Proof of Match, sync again,
and the Switch Report.

00:00:05.202 --> 00:00:10.020
After a switch, Hisaab asks Tally for its own
reports: ledgers, stock,

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:14.487
open bills, the Trial Balance, Profit and
Loss, and the Balance Sheet.

00:00:14.417 --> 00:00:18.633
Then it puts each line next to its own figure.
Equal lines get a tick.

00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:23.951
You can open the proof at any time. Press
Alt+G for Go To, and type proof.

00:00:24.933 --> 00:00:28.150
Press Enter. The Proof of Match opens.

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:35.332
The top line sums it up: 44 of 46 lines match. The i means:
for the other lines, Hisaab found the cause.

00:00:35.362 --> 00:00:40.981
Each line shows the value in the source books, the
value in Hisaab, the difference, and a tick.

00:00:42.061 --> 00:00:46.144
F5 shows only the differences. Here there are
two lines.

00:00:46.174 --> 00:00:52.391
The Sales Accounts line differs by ₹4,500. Its
Match column says: Cause found.

00:00:52.871 --> 00:00:58.221
Tally's Trial Balance gives the group Sales
Accounts as ₹1,99,500.

00:00:58.151 --> 00:01:01.962
But its own ledger lines add up to ₹2,04,000,
the same as

00:01:01.612 --> 00:01:05.769
Hisaab. So the gap is inside Tally's report,
not in your books.

00:01:06.069 --> 00:01:10.621
F6 accepts the difference. Hisaab fills in the
cause as the reason.

00:01:12.069 --> 00:01:18.154
Ctrl+A saves it, and the line shows Accepted. The switch is
done when each line matches, or is accepted.

00:01:19.234 --> 00:01:24.917
Some people still enter bills in Tally for a few days.
Then open Import, Switch from Tally again.

00:01:24.947 --> 00:01:29.898
Press S to sync again. Only the changes come
over: here, one new invoice.

00:01:30.947 --> 00:01:33.630
Then the proof runs again by itself.

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:39.527
The Switch Report keeps the facts of the
switch. In Go To, type switch report.

00:01:39.557 --> 00:01:45.306
It shows the source, the date, the masters and
vouchers, the time of each part, and the proof.

00:01:46.057 --> 00:01:48.808
Each sync again has its own line.

00:01:50.557 --> 00:01:54.466
The last line lists what does not move: users
and passwords,

00:01:54.116 --> 00:01:58.108
the old Edit Log, and print designs. Set them
again in Hisaab.

00:01:58.588 --> 00:02:02.871
Your switch is proven. The next video shows
the Gateway and the keys.

